    {
      "id": "claim_a331fce36fb54f9399c9fb898e6c72a5",
      "statement": "On TERM during the inner daily chain, the shell best-effort emits and uploads a current-stage event with return code 143 before exiting 143; an event object can be absent after a hard kill because the event upload helper treats an absent local file as a warning-only condition.",
      "evidence": [
