      "statement": "`JEF_S3_BUCKET` is mandatory, while `JEF_ASSETS` is a space-separated asset selector defaulting to `AAPL BTC TLT NVDA TSLA IBM`; `JEF_APP_DIR` defaults to `/app` and exists as a stub-friendly test seam for the gating chain.",
