      "statement": "The sync runner contains failures per selected source leg so it can report other legs, but aggregates any failure into `ok=False`; `jef-data sync` writes its requested summary JSON even on a red result and exits nonzero, which lets the daily wrapper diagnose partial acquisition without publishing it normally.",
